📜 <b><%= bot_name %> Premium: Terms</b>

<b>1. What this is.</b> A chat with an AI language model run by an individual (contact: <%= support_contact %>) on their own hardware. It's an AI, not a person, even when its persona says otherwise. Its replies are generated, can be wrong or weird, and aren't advice of any kind.

<b>2. Adults only.</b> You must be 18 or older. Don't use it if you're not.

<b>3. Price & renewal.</b> <%= price %> Telegram Stars per 30 days, charged by Telegram and renewed automatically until you cancel (in ⚙️ Settings, or Telegram Settings → My Stars). Cancelling keeps access until the end of the paid period.

<b>4. Refunds.</b> Ask via /paysupport within 14 days of a payment and it'll be refunded. Refunds end the access that payment bought.

<b>5. Availability.</b> It runs on a home computer, so it's sometimes offline. Messages sent then are answered when it's back, if within about half an hour. No uptime is guaranteed.

<b>6. Acceptable use.</b> Nothing illegal, and nothing sexual involving minors, ever (including fiction). Don't use it to harass anyone. Access can be ended for abuse, with a refund of the current period.

<b>7. Your data.</b> See the /privacy notice.

<b>8. Changes.</b> If these terms change materially, you'll be asked to agree again before your next DM.
